# A container *literal* indexed by a negative constant used to take the compiler down:
# irGen.value handed -1 straight to a Go slice, and the build ended in a Go panic
# (`panic: runtime error: index out of range [-1]`) instead of an IR file or a
# diagnostic. It is folded like any other constant subscript now.
print([1, 2, 3][-1])
print([1, 2, 3][0])
